{"id":"formularios-etiquetas-y-elementos-de-entrada","title":"Formularios - Etiquetas y elementos de entrada","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":1,"words":145,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Los formularios se componen de diversos controles estructurales. Entre los más importantes están <code>&lt;label&gt;</code> (para asociar textos con campos, fundamental para accesibilidad y usabilidad), <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code> (para párrafos extensos o multilínea), <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> (listas desplegables de opción única o múltiple) y <code>&lt;datalist&gt;</code> (sugerencias de autocompletado en un campo de texto estándar).</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 1. Asociación correcta de label e input mediante el atributo &#x27;for&#x27; e &#x27;id&#x27; --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Nombre completo:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;nombre&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 2. Textarea para comentarios o descripciones de múltiples líneas --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mensaje&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Tu mensaje:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">textarea</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mensaje&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mensaje&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rows</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;4&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Escribe aquí tu consulta...&quot;</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">textarea</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 3. Select para opciones desplegables fijas (opción única) --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pais&quot;</span>&gt;</span>País:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">select</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pais&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pais&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Selecciona...<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;es&quot;</span>&gt;</span>España<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;mx&quot;</span>&gt;</span>México<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">select</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- 4. Datalist para sugerir respuestas pero permitiendo escribir cualquier valor --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;navegador&quot;</span>&gt;</span>Navegador favorito:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">list</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;navegadores&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;navegador&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;navegador&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">datalist</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;navegadores&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Chrome&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Firefox&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">option</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">value</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Edge&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">datalist</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}